# GhostCode Dynamics — Admin Panel (frontend)
#
# Base URL of the GhostCode Dynamics API. Leave unset in development: the
# Vite dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:5000, keeping the
# browser same-origin so the httpOnly admin refresh cookie flows without
# CORS changes on the backend.
#
# For production builds served on a different origin from the API, set an
# absolute URL. NOTE: cross-origin deployments additionally require the
# backend to enable CORS credentials for this origin; same-origin or
# reverse-proxy deployments need nothing.
#VITE_ADMIN_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
